{{!
    Airpay Activity Item — Phase B0 iter 4 (2026-05-14)

    Canonical row for any chronological-event list. Used in:
      - Dashboard "Recent Activity" (admin view of team-wide events)
      - Dashboard "Activity Timeline" (learner's own events)
      - Manager team drilldown "What's happened" drawer
      - Course detail "Recent learners" list

    The data layer normalises every source onto this shape — see
    dashboard.php iter-4 transform. Don't pass hex colours; use the
    'variant' field instead so the component can apply the right
    semantic token (which also flips for dark mode).

    Context:
        text          (required) — the headline (already formatted)
        subtext       (optional) — secondary line: timestamp, course
                                   name, locator
        icon          (optional) — FA icon name without "fa-" prefix
        variant       (optional) — semantic colour: "completion" |
                                   "enrolment" | "badge" | "quiz" |
                                   "submission" | "default" | "alert"
        istoday       (optional) — bool. Adds an emphasised dot on the
                                   timeline variant.
        href          (optional) — when present, whole row becomes a
                                   clickable link with :focus-visible.
        layout        (optional) — "inline" (admin Recent Activity row)
                                   or "timeline" (learner timeline w/ dot).
                                   Defaults to "inline".

    Usage:
        Include the partial named "theme_sentientia/components/activity_item".

    Audit fix H1 (2026-05-15): keep this comment free of close-brace pairs.
    See stat_card.mustache for the rationale and a longer explanation.
}}
{{#href}}
<a class="airpay-activity airpay-activity--{{#layout}}{{layout}}{{/layout}}{{^layout}}inline{{/layout}} {{#variant}}airpay-activity--{{variant}}{{/variant}}{{^variant}}airpay-activity--default{{/variant}}{{#istoday}} airpay-activity--today{{/istoday}}"
   href="{{href}}">
{{/href}}
{{^href}}
<div class="airpay-activity airpay-activity--{{#layout}}{{layout}}{{/layout}}{{^layout}}inline{{/layout}} {{#variant}}airpay-activity--{{variant}}{{/variant}}{{^variant}}airpay-activity--default{{/variant}}{{#istoday}} airpay-activity--today{{/istoday}}">
{{/href}}
    <div class="airpay-activity__marker" aria-hidden="true">
        {{#icon}}
        <i class="fa fa-{{icon}}"></i>
        {{/icon}}
    </div>
    <div class="airpay-activity__body">
        <p class="airpay-activity__text">{{text}}</p>
        {{#subtext}}
        <p class="airpay-activity__subtext">{{subtext}}</p>
        {{/subtext}}
    </div>
{{#href}}
</a>
{{/href}}
{{^href}}
</div>
{{/href}}
